{"text":"<p>https://youtu.be/KI8kV4waf5A?si=yeT4wPtrDIB80l2S</p><p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> # Abhidhammapiṭake</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3.147311990463257\">00:03</span> ## Yamakapāḷi ^6-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4.913578\">00:04</span> ### Mūlayamakaṃ ^6-1-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>#### (Ka) Uddeso</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**1. Mūlavāro**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**1. Kusalā dhammā**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(1) Mūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10.523704\">00:10</span> 1. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlā? ^6-1-1</p>\n<p>(Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21.419331\">00:21</span> 2. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlā? ^6-1-2</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"28.065476\">00:28</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"34.855958\">00:34</span> 3. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlā? ^6-1-3</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"44.190344\">00:44</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(2) Mūlamūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"51.92079\">00:51</span> 4. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlamūlā? ^6-1-4</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"57.9104\">00:57</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"63.794554\">01:03</span> 5. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā? ^6-1-5</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"71.293688\">01:11</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"78.303572\">01:18</span> 6. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā? ^6-1-6</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"88.876084\">01:28</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(3) Mūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"97.245645\">01:37</span> 7. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlakā? ^6-1-7</p>\n<p>(Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"107.349457\">01:47</span> 8. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlakā? ^6-1-8</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"114.311184\">01:54</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"121.599459\">02:01</span> 9. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlakā? ^6-1-9</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"131.583614\">02:11</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(4) Mūlamūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"139.455144\">02:19</span> 10. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlamūlakā? ^6-1-10</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"145.441226\">02:25</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"151.634845\">02:31</span> 11. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā? ^6-1-11</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"158.602918\">02:38</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"166.654986\">02:46</span> 12. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā? ^6-1-12</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"176.934488\">02:56</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**2. Akusalā dhammā** ^6-1a-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(1) Mūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"185.166382\">03:05</span> 13. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlā? ^6-1a-13</p>\n<p>(Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"200.808973\">03:20</span> 14. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlā? ^6-1a-14</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"207.647578\">03:27</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena ekamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"215.079894\">03:35</span> 15. (Ka) ye keci akusalamūlena ekamūlā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlā? ^6-1a-15</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"224.483821\">03:44</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(2) Mūlamūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"232.360776\">03:52</span> 16. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlamūlā? ^6-1a-16</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"238.543624\">03:58</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"244.935197\">04:04</span> 17. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā? ^6-1a-17</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"252.213318\">04:12</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"259.477459\">04:19</span> 18. (Ka) ye keci akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā? ^6-1a-18</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"270.961569\">04:30</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(3) Mūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"279.17954\">04:39</span> 19. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlakā? ^6-1a-19</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"284.979637\">04:44</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"291.065844\">04:51</span> 20. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlakā? ^6-1a-20</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"298.326306\">04:58</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena ekamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"305.790063\">05:05</span> 21. (Ka) ye keci akusalamūlena ekamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlakā? ^6-1a-21</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"316.134258\">05:16</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(4) Mūlamūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"323.996853\">05:23</span> 22. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlamūlakā? ^6-1a-22</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"330.293199\">05:30</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"336.743563\">05:36</span> 23. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā? ^6-1a-23</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"344.486635\">05:44</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"352.507766\">05:52</span> 24. (Ka) ye keci akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā? ^6-1a-24</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"363.810708\">06:03</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**3. Abyākatā dhammā** ^6-1b-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(1) Mūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"372.65524\">06:12</span> 25. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlā? ^6-1b-25</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"383.62948\">06:23</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"390.184115\">06:30</span> 26. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena ekamūlā? ^6-1b-26</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"397.933066\">06:37</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena ekamūlā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"405.651305\">06:45</span> 27. (Ka) ye keci abyākatamūlena ekamūlā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlā? ^6-1b-27</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"416.278294\">06:56</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(2) Mūlamūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"424.549098\">07:04</span> 28. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlamūlā? ^6-1b-28</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"431.465116\">07:11</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"438.439837\">07:18</span> 29. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena ekamūlamūlā? ^6-1b-29</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"447.055387\">07:27</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena ekamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"455.778779\">07:35</span> 30. (Ka) ye keci abyākatamūlena ekamūlamūlā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā? ^6-1b-30</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"467.132456\">07:47</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(3) Mūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"476.51884\">07:56</span> 31. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlakā? ^6-1b-31</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"483.294979\">08:03</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"490.066676\">08:10</span> 32. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena ekamūlakā? ^6-1b-32</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"497.951358\">08:17</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena ekamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"506.661288\">08:26</span> 33. (Ka) ye keci abyākatamūlena ekamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlakā? ^6-1b-33</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"516.943313\">08:36</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(4) Mūlamūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"525.836161\">08:45</span> 34. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlamūlakā? ^6-1b-34</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"533.265289\">08:53</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"540.346697\">09:00</span> 35. (Ka) ye keci abyākatā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena ekamūlamūlakā? ^6-1b-35</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"548.598979\">09:08</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena ekamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"557.333157\">09:17</span> 36. (Ka) ye keci abyākatamūlena ekamūlamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā? ^6-1b-36</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"568.935472\">09:28</span> (Kha) ye vā pana abyākatamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā abyākatā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**4. Nāmā dhammā** ^6-1c-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(1) Mūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"578.857098\">09:38</span> 37. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlā? ^6-1c-37</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"588.748168\">09:48</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"593.988265\">09:53</span> 38. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena ekamūlā? ^6-1c-38</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"600.725003\">10:00</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena ekamūlā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"607.65261\">10:07</span> 39. (Ka) ye keci nāmamūlena ekamūlā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlā? ^6-1c-39</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"617.258684\">10:17</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(2) Mūlamūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"624.753063\">10:24</span> 40. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlamūlā? ^6-1c-40</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"630.399196\">10:30</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"636.13497\">10:36</span> 41. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena ekamūlamūlā? ^6-1c-41</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"643.373735\">10:43</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena ekamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"651.258537\">10:51</span> 42. (Ka) ye keci nāmamūlena ekamūlamūlā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā? ^6-1c-42</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"661.435244\">11:01</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(3) Mūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"670.089504\">11:10</span> 43. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlakā? ^6-1c-43</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"675.509476\">11:15</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"680.991451\">11:20</span> 44. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena ekamūlakā? ^6-1c-44</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"688.284672\">11:28</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena ekamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"695.435859\">11:35</span> 45. (Ka) ye keci nāmamūlena ekamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlakā? ^6-1c-45</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"705.189255\">11:45</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(4) Mūlamūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"713.044054\">11:53</span> 46. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlamūlakā? ^6-1c-46</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"719.257872\">11:59</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"725.177884\">12:05</span> 47. (Ka) ye keci nāmā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena ekamūlamūlakā? ^6-1c-47</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"732.969042\">12:12</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena ekamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"740.657488\">12:20</span> 48. (Ka) ye keci nāmamūlena ekamūlamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā? ^6-1c-48</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"751.482143\">12:31</span> (Kha) ye vā pana nāmamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā nāmā?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"759.582332\">12:39</span> Mūlavārauddeso.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**2-10. Hetuvārādi** ^6-1d-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"767.302828\">12:47</span> 49. Ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalahetū…pe… kusalanidānā…pe… kusalasambhavā…pe… kusalappabhavā…pe… kusalasamuṭṭhānā…pe… kusalāhārā…pe… kusalārammaṇā…pe… kusalapaccayā…pe… kusalasamudayā…pe…. ^6-1d-49</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"805.115127\">13:25</span> Mūlaṃ hetu nidānañca, sambhavo pabhavena ca;</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"817.972745\">13:37</span> Samuṭṭhānāhārārammaṇā [samuṭṭhānāhārārammaṇaṃ (ka.)], paccayo samudayena cāti.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"828.139496\">13:48</span> Uddesavāro niṭṭhito.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>#### (Kha) Niddeso</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**1. Mūlavāro** ^6-1e-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**1. Kusalā dhammā** ^6-1f-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(1) Mūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"832.924616\">13:52</span> 50. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlāti? Tīṇeva kusalamūlāni. Avasesā kusalā dhammā na kusalamūlā. ^6-1f-50</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"851.637904\">14:11</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"858.931971\">14:18</span> 51. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlāti? Āmantā. ^6-1f-51</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"868.023777\">14:28</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"875.137023\">14:35</span> Kusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlaṃ, na kusalaṃ. Kusalaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlañceva kusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"888.834642\">14:48</span> 52. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlāti? ^6-1f-52</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"898.914654\">14:58</span> Mūlāni yāni ekato uppajjanti kusalamūlāni ekamūlāni ceva aññamaññamūlāni ca. Avasesā kusalamūlasahajātā dhammā kusalamūlena ekamūlā, na ca aññamaññamūlā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"920.852109\">15:20</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(2) Mūlamūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"930.855025\">15:30</span> 53. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlamūlāti? Tīṇeva kusalamūlamūlāni. Avasesā kusalā dhammā na kusalamūlamūlā. ^6-1f-53</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"946.574027\">15:46</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"954.906754\">15:54</span> 54. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlāti? Āmantā. ^6-1f-54</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"964.247764\">16:04</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"972.059438\">16:12</span> Kusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlaṃ, na kusalaṃ. Kusalaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlañceva kusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"986.128583\">16:26</span> 55. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlāti? ^6-1f-55</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"997.506077\">16:37</span> Mūlāni yāni ekato uppajjanti kusalamūlāni ekamūlamūlāni ceva aññamaññamūlamūlāni ca. Avasesā kusalamūlasahajātā dhammā kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā, na ca aññamaññamūlamūlā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1020.305482\">17:00</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(3) Mūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1030.881658\">17:10</span> 56. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlakāti? Āmantā. ^6-1f-56</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1038.29097\">17:18</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1044.102807\">17:24</span> Kusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kusalamūlakaṃ na kusalaṃ. Kusalaṃ kusalamūlakañceva kusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1054.014857\">17:34</span> 57. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlakāti? Āmantā. ^6-1f-57</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1062.765651\">17:42</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1070.604434\">17:50</span> Kusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlakaṃ, na kusalaṃ. Kusalaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlakañceva kusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1084.098654\">18:04</span> 58. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlakāti? ^6-1f-58</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1094.436396\">18:14</span> Mūlāni yāni ekato uppajjanti kusalamūlāni ekamūlakāni ceva aññamaññamūlakāni ca. Avasesā kusalamūlasahajātā dhammā kusalamūlena ekamūlakā, na ca aññamaññamūlakā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1114.542901\">18:34</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(4) Mūlamūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1124.52147\">18:44</span> 59. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlamūlakāti? Āmantā. ^6-1f-59</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1132.152789\">18:52</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1138.44061\">18:58</span> Kusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kusalamūlamūlakaṃ na kusalaṃ. Kusalaṃ kusalamūlamūlakañceva kusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1150.025034\">19:10</span> 60. (Ka) ye keci kusalā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakāti? Āmantā. ^6-1f-60</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1159.611318\">19:19</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1167.520494\">19:27</span> Kusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakaṃ, na kusalaṃ. Kusalaṃ kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakañceva kusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1180.993756\">19:40</span> 61. (Ka) ye keci kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā dhammā, sabbe te kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakāti? ^6-1f-61</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1191.8234\">19:51</span> Mūlāni yāni ekato uppajjanti kusalamūlāni ekamūlamūlakāni ceva aññamaññamūlamūlakāni ca. Avasesā kusalamūlasahajātā dhammā kusalamūlena ekamūlamūlakā, na ca aññamaññamūlamūlakā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1214.88614\">20:14</span> (Kha) ye vā pana kusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā kusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**2. Akusalā dhammā** ^6-1g-0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(1) Mūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1225.784179\">20:25</span> 62. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlāti? ^6-1g-62</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1234.819562\">20:34</span> Tīṇeva akusalamūlāni. Avasesā akusalā dhammā na akusalamūlā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1242.85493\">20:42</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1250.298625\">20:50</span> 63. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlāti? ^6-1g-63</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1257.588516\">20:57</span> Ahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlena na ekamūlaṃ. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlaṃ.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1268.502599\">21:08</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena ekamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1275.940822\">21:15</span> Akusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlaṃ, na akusalaṃ. Akusalaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlañceva akusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1289.236541\">21:29</span> 64. (Ka) ye keci akusalamūlena ekamūlā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlāti? ^6-1g-64</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1298.987748\">21:38</span> Mūlāni yāni ekato uppajjanti akusalamūlāni ekamūlāni ceva aññamaññamūlāni ca. Avasesā akusalamūlasahajātā dhammā akusalamūlena ekamūlā, na ca aññamaññamūlā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1319.73535\">21:59</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(2) Mūlamūlanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1329.572469\">22:09</span> 65. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlamūlāti? ^6-1g-65</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1335.768449\">22:15</span> Tīṇeva akusalamūlamūlāni. Avasesā akusalā dhammā na akusalamūlamūlā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1344.919691\">22:24</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1353.196349\">22:33</span> 66. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlāti? ^6-1g-66</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1361.122306\">22:41</span> Ahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlena na ekamūlamūlaṃ. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlaṃ.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1372.710673\">22:52</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1381.052657\">23:01</span> Akusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlaṃ, na akusalaṃ. Akusalaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlañceva akusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1395.591861\">23:15</span> 67. (Ka) ye keci akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlāti? ^6-1g-67</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1406.842525\">23:26</span> Mūlāni yāni ekato uppajjanti akusalamūlāni ekamūlamūlāni ceva aññamaññamūlamūlāni ca. Avasesā akusalamūlasahajātā dhammā akusalamūlena ekamūlamūlā, na ca aññamaññamūlamūlā.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1429.618263\">23:49</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlena aññamaññamūlamūlā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti? Āmantā.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**(3) Mūlakanayo**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1440.034478\">24:00</span> 68. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlakāti? ^6-1g-68</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1446.332441\">24:06</span> Ahetukaṃ akusalaṃ na akusalamūlakaṃ. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlakaṃ.</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1454.213646\">24:14</span> (Kha) ye vā pana akusalamūlakā, sabbe te dhammā akusalāti?</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1460.399174\">24:20</span> Akusalasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ akusalamūlakaṃ na akusalaṃ. Akusalaṃ akusalamūlakañceva akusalañca.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1471.389583\">24:31</span> 69. (Ka) ye keci akusalā dhammā, sabbe te akusalamūlena ekamūlakāti? ^6-1g-69</p>\n<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1479.19968\">24:39</span> Ahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlena na ekamūlakaṃ. Sahetukaṃ akusalaṃ akusalamūlena ekamūlakaṃ.</p>\n<p><spa